ind":"announcement","title":"Saying Goodbye to Difficulty Options","summary":"After a lot of internal debate, we've decided to remove difficulty options from Crown's Trial. We believe a core identity of the game is challenge and difficulty. We want everyone to face the same trial (pun intended). So that when you talk about a boss with another player or streamer, you're talking about the same fight.This wasn't a decision we made lightly, Especially after putting precious development time into adding the difficulty feature in the first place and we know it won't land the sa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-26T11:08:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357033599","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4135440-1837955055356697","game_id":"steam-4135440","kind":"announcement","title":"Crown's Trial DEMO is out NOW!","summary":"","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-10T12:22:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055356697","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4135440-1833968530895321","game_id":"steam-4135440","kind":"announcement","title":"Crown's Trial Playtest #2 Now Live!","summary":"A second chance to test Crown's Trial for those who missed it. For those that tried previously, we have added the following: Difficulty OptionsPerfect Side stepParrying","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-31T13:00:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530895321","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4135440-1833334318572317","game_id":"steam-4135440","kind":"announcement","title":"New Mechanic: Perfect Dodge","summary":"Sidestepping at the very last second will now trigger perfect dodge. You gain a stamina buff and increased action speed for a short duration.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-22T16:43:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318572317","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4135440-1833334318568311","game_id":"steam-4135440","kind":"update","title":"Patch notes: Balance changes","summary":"Slightly increase to player hpSlight decrease to gladiator boss hpSome attack hitbox fixesDefault controller bindings changeStraw boss vfx polishSidestep slight increase in i-framesColosseum change spawn in camera angleDecrease sprint delayPlayer now heals fasterUi that tell you about abilitiesKick rotationTooltip widgetBlocking buff: now blocks more damage and consumes a bit more stamina","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-21T09:03:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318568311","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4135440-1832700592801093","game_id":"steam-4135440","kind":"announcement","title":"Crown's Trial Playtest Now Live!","summary":"Opening cutscene, tutorial, and the gladiator boss fight are included. We estimate around 2 hours of content. Also, for those that only played with keyboard and mouse last time, controller is now fully supported! Have a go at it and let us know what you think!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-19T14:06:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/183270059280109